   "reason": "Make expands variables and functions before it builds anything, and this Pack does not expand. A name produced by expansion -- the targets of `$(OBJS): %.o`, the prerequisite `$(SRC_DIR)/main.c`, the variable `$($(TOOL)_FLAGS)` -- is stated as the literal words it is written with, so the target, prerequisite or variable it becomes at build time is not declared or referenced."
